.TH CBMAP_RESET 3 "2026-10-31" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cbmap_reset \- clear all entries from a BST map (type-inferred wrapper)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cbstmap.h>

cbmap_reset(cbm);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-inferred wrapper for cbstmap_reset(). It takes the same arguments
and gives the same result; cbstmap_reset(3) has the full contract.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
cbm    BST map to reset
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
ccol_success on success, as cbstmap_reset(3) gives it.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbstmap_reset (3)
